OL,3,ABystander 'heroically intervened' after
OL,4,Athree children and teacher killed in US
OL,5,Aschool shooting
OL,6,
OL,7,FFour victims, including a teacher and
OL,8,Fchildren aged five, eight and 11, were
OL,9,Fkilled in a shooting at an elementary
OL,10,Fschool in the US state of Oregon, local
OL,11,Fpolice say
OL,13,FThe attacker, a 16-year-old boy, forced
OL,14,Fhis way into the school by firing at
OL,15,Flocked doors. He was also killed in the
OL,16,Fshooting
OL,18,FPolice in Bend, Oregon, responded after
OL,19,Freceiving a call that an armed person
OL,20,Fhad fired at a car before he was seen
OL,21,Fgoing into the Silver Rail Elementary
OL,22,FSchool with a long gun
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
