OL,3,ABystander 'heroically intervened' after
OL,4,Athree children and teacher killed in US
OL,5,Aschool shooting
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe suspect was gunned down by an armed
OL,8,Fmember of the community who followed
OL,9,Fthe suspect inside the school, police
OL,10,Fsay
OL,12,FTwo additional victims, a
OL,13,Fseven-year-old and another teacher,
OL,14,Fwere hurt and transported to hospital.
OL,15,FThey are both in critical condition
OL,17,FLives have been "forever changed" by
OL,18,Fthis tragedy, Oregon Governor Tina
OL,19,FKotek says
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
